TI  - Enhancement mechanism of wet-carbonated recycled concrete aggregates subjected to calcium-rich and magnesium-rich industrial reclaimed wastewater sources
PY  - 2025
T2  - Cement and Concrete Composites
VL  - 158
C7  - 105983
