TI  - Low-Carbon Bio-Concretes with Wood, Bamboo, and Rice Husk Aggregates: Life Cycle Assessment for Sustainable Wall Systems
PY  - 2025
T2  - Sustainability (Switzerland)
VL  - 17
IS  - 5
