TI  - A Theoretical and Numerical Approach to Ensure Ductile Failure in Strengthened Reinforced Concrete Slabs with Fiber-Reinforced Polymer Sheets
PY  - 2025
T2  - Buildings
VL  - 15
IS  - 5
C7  - 831
